🌍 WORLD LOGIC (LOCKED)

This is not a ship in the normal sense.
This is a flying industrial district built around a colossal spherical core.

The sphere is wrapped in scars, antennae, platforms, exposed piping, maintenance scaffolds, and parasitic sub-structures.
Below it hangs a dense mechanical undercity of engines, docking arms, tanks, ducts, and suspended modules.

Airspace is not open.
Airspace is machinery.

Small craft, missiles, exhaust plumes, and debris move through the gaps between structural masses.
The ocean far below is visible through breaks in cloud cover.
Cloud banks engulf sections of the structure unpredictably.
Thruster output is powerful enough to distort vapor, turbulence, and camera stability.

This is not a battlefield.
This is a flying megastructure under live stress.

